{"segs": ["PA_ja_153:0.4"], "en": "3. The Sūkara-jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_153:1.1"], "en": "“I am four-footed, my friend;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_153:1.2"], "en": "you too, my friend, are four-footed.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_153:1.3"], "en": "\"Come, friend, turn back;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_153:1.4"], "en": "why do you flee in fear?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_153:2.1"], "en": "\"I am impure and my hair is putrid.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_153:2.2"], "en": "\"You are a foul-smelling pig;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_153:2.3"], "en": "if you wish to fight,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_153:2.4"], "en": "friend, I grant you victory.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_153:3.1"], "en": "The Third Jātaka: The Boar Jātaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
